<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" ?>
<tt xml:lang="en" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" ttp:profile="http://www.w3.org/TR/profile/sdp-us" >
<head>
<styling>
<style xml:id="s1" tts:textAlign="center" tts:extent="90% 90%" tts:origin="5% 5%" tts:displayAlign="after"/>
<style xml:id="s2" tts:fontSize=".72c" tts:backgroundColor="black" tts:color="white"/>
</styling>
<layout>
<region xml:id="r1" style="s1"/>
</layout>
</head>
<body region="r1">
<div>
<p begin="00:00:00.000" end="00:00:04.584" style="s2">What a beautiful day.</p>
<p begin="00:00:03.400" end="00:00:06.604" style="s2">&gt;&gt; HELLO.</p>
<p begin="00:00:04.584" end="00:00:06.604" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [screaming]</p>
<p begin="00:00:09.360" end="00:00:14.080" style="s2">&gt;&gt; PLEASE DON&#39;T EAT ME.</p>
<p begin="00:00:10.920" end="00:00:15.920" style="s2">&gt;&gt; HAVE YOU EVER SEEN A FROG eat a person?</p>
<p begin="00:00:14.080" end="00:00:18.880" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then what do you eat? Bugs?</p>
<p begin="00:00:15.920" end="00:00:19.480" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ew, no. Apples, bananas, salad, mushroom</p>
<p begin="00:00:18.880" end="00:00:23.400" style="s2">soup.</p>
<p begin="00:00:19.480" end="00:00:23.400" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Wait. You&#39;re a vegetarian?</p>
<p begin="00:00:25.080" end="00:00:28.840" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I am.</p>
<p begin="00:00:26.120" end="00:00:28.840" style="s2">But he&#39;s not.</p>
<p begin="00:00:29.840" end="00:00:33.560" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What are you doing?</p>
<p begin="00:00:30.800" end="00:00:33.560" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Saving you.</p>
<p begin="00:00:38.000" end="00:00:42.360" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You could have warned me.</p>
<p begin="00:00:39.400" end="00:00:42.360" style="s2">&gt;&gt; There wasn&#39;t time.</p>
<p begin="00:00:45.640" end="00:00:48.760" style="s2">We&#39;re safe.</p>
<p begin="00:00:47.160" end="00:00:50.080" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thanks for saving me.</p>
<p begin="00:00:48.760" end="00:00:52.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re welcome.</p>
<p begin="00:00:50.080" end="00:00:54.365" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re not like any frog I&#39;ve ever met.</p>
<p begin="00:00:52.720" end="00:00:54.640" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How many frogs have you met?</p>
<p begin="00:00:54.365" end="00:00:56.560" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:00:54.640" end="00:00:57.840" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Good point. I&#39;m Agnes.</p>
<p begin="00:00:56.560" end="00:00:59.960" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Frank.</p>
<p begin="00:00:57.840" end="00:01:02.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I hope I see you again, Frank.</p>
<p begin="00:00:59.960" end="00:01:02.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Me, too.</p>
<p begin="00:01:05.920" end="00:01:12.760" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Where is that idiot? I&#39;m starving.</p>
<p begin="00:01:09.040" end="00:01:12.760" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Frank should be back soon, Your Majesty.</p>
<p begin="00:01:14.160" end="00:01:18.760" style="s2">You just ate three muscos.</p>
<p begin="00:01:16.040" end="00:01:21.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Those were snacks.</p>
<p begin="00:01:18.760" end="00:01:23.400" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Good news. I found strawberries.</p>
<p begin="00:01:21.000" end="00:01:24.280" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s not good news. What&#39;s all this</p>
<p begin="00:01:23.400" end="00:01:25.440" style="s2">garbage?</p>
<p begin="00:01:24.280" end="00:01:29.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s fruit, madam.</p>
<p begin="00:01:25.440" end="00:01:31.080" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I told you to bring bugs, real food.</p>
<p begin="00:01:29.720" end="00:01:33.640" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This is real food. Try it.</p>
<p begin="00:01:31.080" end="00:01:36.640" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It smells [snorts] like a garden.</p>
<p begin="00:01:33.640" end="00:01:36.640" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s why it&#39;s good, madam.</p>
<p begin="00:01:38.360" end="00:01:42.920" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You still call me madam. Call me Molly.</p>
<p begin="00:01:41.280" end="00:01:46.040" style="s2">We&#39;re getting married.</p>
<p begin="00:01:42.920" end="00:01:47.960" style="s2">&gt;&gt; W- We&#39;re doing what?</p>
<p begin="00:01:46.040" end="00:01:50.840" style="s2">You saved me from a bear. I promised to</p>
<p begin="00:01:47.960" end="00:01:52.400" style="s2">serve you, not marry a frog.</p>
<p begin="00:01:50.840" end="00:01:53.400" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Here we go again. You think you&#39;re a</p>
<p begin="00:01:52.400" end="00:01:54.920" style="s2">cursed human?</p>
<p begin="00:01:53.400" end="00:01:56.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I don&#39;t think it.</p>
<p begin="00:01:54.920" end="00:02:00.240" style="s2">I am.</p>
<p begin="00:01:56.720" end="00:02:02.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then look at yourself. You&#39;re a frog and</p>
<p begin="00:02:00.240" end="00:02:03.160" style="s2">you&#39;re going to be my husband.</p>
<p begin="00:02:02.000" end="00:02:07.479" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Not happening.</p>
<p begin="00:02:03.160" end="00:02:09.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Gods, lock him up UNTIL THE WEDDING.</p>
<p begin="00:02:07.479" end="00:02:11.560" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I WON&#39;T MARRY YOU. I&#39;M NOT I&#39;M NOT a</p>
<p begin="00:02:09.000" end="00:02:11.560" style="s2">frog.</p>
<p begin="00:02:14.480" end="00:02:19.240" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Keep moving.</p>
<p begin="00:02:15.520" end="00:02:20.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I am moving. You&#39;re dragging me.</p>
<p begin="00:02:19.240" end="00:02:23.360" style="s2">You can&#39;t keep me here.</p>
<p begin="00:02:20.520" end="00:02:23.360" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes, we can.</p>
<p begin="00:02:25.120" end="00:02:27.959" style="s2">Nice try.</p>
<p begin="00:02:26.080" end="00:02:29.760" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh, come on.</p>
<p begin="00:02:27.959" end="00:02:31.080" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The wedding is tomorrow morning. I want</p>
<p begin="00:02:29.760" end="00:02:32.120" style="s2">everything perfect.</p>
<p begin="00:02:31.080" end="00:02:35.800" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Does Frank know?</p>
<p begin="00:02:32.120" end="00:02:37.160" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He doesn&#39;t need to know. Just decorate.</p>
<p begin="00:02:35.800" end="00:02:40.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What if he says no?</p>
<p begin="00:02:37.160" end="00:02:40.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He already did. I ignored him.</p>
<p begin="00:02:42.520" end="00:02:44.600" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dinner?</p>
<p begin="00:02:43.560" end="00:02:45.640" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Absolutely not.</p>
<p begin="00:02:44.600" end="00:02:47.320" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re a frog.</p>
<p begin="00:02:45.640" end="00:02:50.280" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m a vegetarian.</p>
<p begin="00:02:47.320" end="00:02:52.080" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Fine, more for me.</p>
<p begin="00:02:50.280" end="00:02:54.959" style="s2">The wedding&#39;s tomorrow.</p>
<p begin="00:02:52.080" end="00:02:54.959" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Tomorrow?</p>
<p begin="00:02:56.000" end="00:03:01.360" style="s2">I have to get out of here.</p>
<p begin="00:02:57.800" end="00:03:04.519" style="s2">Come on. Move. Ow.</p>
<p begin="00:03:01.360" end="00:03:07.360" style="s2">Almost. Come on.</p>
<p begin="00:03:04.519" end="00:03:07.360" style="s2">Seriously?</p>
<p begin="00:03:08.519" end="00:03:14.239" style="s2">It&#39;s morning already.</p>
<p begin="00:03:10.200" end="00:03:15.680" style="s2">I tried all night and I&#39;m still stuck.</p>
<p begin="00:03:14.239" end="00:03:17.959" style="s2">&gt;&gt; For a frog,</p>
<p begin="00:03:15.680" end="00:03:19.959" style="s2">he&#39;s actually really handsome.</p>
<p begin="00:03:17.959" end="00:03:23.360" style="s2">Why do I keep thinking about him?</p>
<p begin="00:03:19.959" end="00:03:23.360" style="s2">Get out of my head, green boy.</p>
<p begin="00:03:25.239" end="00:03:29.480" style="s2">Okay.</p>
<p begin="00:03:26.680" end="00:03:29.480" style="s2">One more look.</p>
<p begin="00:03:31.239" end="00:03:36.080" style="s2">I really want to see him.</p>
<p begin="00:03:33.680" end="00:03:37.959" style="s2">But what would I even say?</p>
<p begin="00:03:36.080" end="00:03:40.400" style="s2">I can come up with an excuse. I just</p>
<p begin="00:03:37.959" end="00:03:42.400" style="s2">need one. What do I say? What do I say?</p>
<p begin="00:03:40.400" end="00:03:44.560" style="s2">What do I say?</p>
<p begin="00:03:42.400" end="00:03:47.000" style="s2">Thanks for saving me, Frank.</p>
<p begin="00:03:44.560" end="00:03:50.360" style="s2">Too serious. Hey, frog boy. Want some</p>
<p begin="00:03:47.000" end="00:03:50.360" style="s2">lunch? Worse.</p>
<p begin="00:03:51.959" end="00:03:58.080" style="s2">He said he likes salad. I&#39;m just being</p>
<p begin="00:03:53.960" end="00:03:58.080" style="s2">polite. I don&#39;t miss him at all.</p>
<p begin="00:03:58.760" end="00:04:02.800" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Careful. This dress is priceless.</p>
<p begin="00:04:01.240" end="00:04:04.160" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So is my back.</p>
<p begin="00:04:02.800" end="00:04:07.040" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What did you say?</p>
<p begin="00:04:04.160" end="00:04:09.920" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I said you look beautiful.</p>
<p begin="00:04:07.040" end="00:04:09.920" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Obviously.</p>
<p begin="00:04:12.959" end="00:04:15.200" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let go of the tree.</p>
<p begin="00:04:14.280" end="00:04:16.280" style="s2">&gt;&gt; go of me.</p>
<p begin="00:04:15.200" end="00:04:20.037" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We can do this all day.</p>
<p begin="00:04:16.280" end="00:04:21.799" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Good. The wedding can wait.</p>
<p begin="00:04:20.037" end="00:04:23.600" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [groaning]</p>
<p begin="00:04:21.799" end="00:04:24.560" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m not marrying her.</p>
<p begin="00:04:23.600" end="00:04:27.160" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Tell the queen.</p>
<p begin="00:04:24.560" end="00:04:30.240" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I did.</p>
<p begin="00:04:27.160" end="00:04:32.400" style="s2">I&#39;M NOT A FROG. I need to marry a human.</p>
<p begin="00:04:30.240" end="00:04:34.560" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sit down.</p>
<p begin="00:04:32.400" end="00:04:36.400" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I am sitting against my will.</p>
<p begin="00:04:34.560" end="00:04:40.800" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You should be grateful. You&#39;re marrying</p>
<p begin="00:04:36.400" end="00:04:40.800" style="s2">the most beautiful queen in the world.</p>
<p begin="00:04:42.800" end="00:04:46.919" style="s2">Was that a laugh?</p>
<p begin="00:04:45.240" end="00:04:48.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No. I I coughed.</p>
<p begin="00:04:46.919" end="00:04:51.480" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You think you have better options? You</p>
<p begin="00:04:48.720" end="00:04:53.960" style="s2">really think a human would marry you?</p>
<p begin="00:04:51.480" end="00:04:53.960" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Maybe.</p>
<p begin="00:04:54.160" end="00:04:58.480" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Fine. Let&#39;s find out.</p>
<p begin="00:04:55.919" end="00:04:59.680" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Bring me a human girl. Now.</p>
<p begin="00:04:58.480" end="00:05:02.560" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Leave her out of this.</p>
<p begin="00:04:59.680" end="00:05:04.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If she won&#39;t marry you, you&#39;ll massage</p>
<p begin="00:05:02.560" end="00:05:06.080" style="s2">my feet forever.</p>
<p begin="00:05:04.000" end="00:05:09.760" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s not a deal. That&#39;s a nightmare.</p>
<p begin="00:05:06.080" end="00:05:09.760" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then hope SHE SAYS YES. GO.</p>
<p begin="00:05:10.800" end="00:05:14.760" style="s2">&gt;&gt; OKAY, FRANK. Here I come.</p>
<p begin="00:05:13.080" end="00:05:15.280" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Princess Agnes, your parents want to see</p>
<p begin="00:05:14.760" end="00:05:16.120" style="s2">you.</p>
<p begin="00:05:15.280" end="00:05:18.680" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Right now?</p>
<p begin="00:05:16.120" end="00:05:18.680" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Right now.</p>
<p begin="00:05:20.880" end="00:05:23.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The guard said you came home late</p>
<p begin="00:05:22.640" end="00:05:26.120" style="s2">yesterday.</p>
<p begin="00:05:23.440" end="00:05:28.760" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Agnes, where did you go this time?</p>
<p begin="00:05:26.120" end="00:05:30.480" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I was in the forest. A giant frog saved</p>
<p begin="00:05:28.760" end="00:05:32.400" style="s2">me from a lion.</p>
<p begin="00:05:30.480" end="00:05:35.200" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A giant frog saved you?</p>
<p begin="00:05:32.400" end="00:05:36.640" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes. His name is Frank, and he was</p>
<p begin="00:05:35.200" end="00:05:38.560" style="s2">really nice.</p>
<p begin="00:05:36.640" end="00:05:40.200" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Enough.</p>
<p begin="00:05:38.560" end="00:05:41.640" style="s2">You&#39;re not going back to that forest.</p>
<p begin="00:05:40.200" end="00:05:42.960" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You can&#39;t keep me trapped in this</p>
<p begin="00:05:41.640" end="00:05:45.240" style="s2">palace.</p>
<p begin="00:05:42.960" end="00:05:47.240" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Agnes, every princess your age is</p>
<p begin="00:05:45.240" end="00:05:48.600" style="s2">married, and you&#39;re still wasting time</p>
<p begin="00:05:47.240" end="00:05:51.400" style="s2">wandering through the forest.</p>
<p begin="00:05:48.600" end="00:05:53.640" style="s2">&gt;&gt; With a giant frog.</p>
<p begin="00:05:51.400" end="00:05:53.880" style="s2">What a ridiculous story.</p>
<p begin="00:05:53.640" end="00:05:55.480" style="s2">&gt;&gt; But</p>
<p begin="00:05:53.880" end="00:05:57.880" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We don&#39;t have time for this nonsense,</p>
<p begin="00:05:55.480" end="00:05:59.520" style="s2">Agnes. The kingdom is going broke.</p>
<p begin="00:05:57.880" end="00:06:01.880" style="s2">There&#39;s no money left.</p>
<p begin="00:05:59.520" end="00:06:04.280" style="s2">&gt;&gt; People are going hungry.</p>
<p begin="00:06:01.880" end="00:06:06.840" style="s2">We&#39;ve made a decision.</p>
<p begin="00:06:04.280" end="00:06:08.320" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What decision?</p>
<p begin="00:06:06.840" end="00:06:10.760" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re getting married.</p>
<p begin="00:06:08.320" end="00:06:12.840" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What? No, I&#39;m not getting married.</p>
<p begin="00:06:10.760" end="00:06:14.680" style="s2">&gt;&gt; King Edgar offered enough gold to save</p>
<p begin="00:06:12.840" end="00:06:17.360" style="s2">our kingdom.</p>
<p begin="00:06:14.680" end="00:06:19.080" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And what does he want?</p>
<p begin="00:06:17.360" end="00:06:21.280" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You.</p>
<p begin="00:06:19.080" end="00:06:23.160" style="s2">He wants you as his wife.</p>
<p begin="00:06:21.280" end="00:06:24.400" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You can&#39;t trade me for gold.</p>
<p begin="00:06:23.160" end="00:06:26.760" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Like it or not, you have to marry</p>
<p begin="00:06:24.400" end="00:06:28.760" style="s2">someday. Why not someone rich? Edgar&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:06:26.760" end="00:06:30.600" style="s2">the only wealthy single king nearby.</p>
<p begin="00:06:28.760" end="00:06:31.680" style="s2">There was one prince, Frank, but he</p>
<p begin="00:06:30.600" end="00:06:33.640" style="s2">vanished years ago.</p>
<p begin="00:06:31.680" end="00:06:34.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And that Frank was a real prince, not</p>
<p begin="00:06:33.640" end="00:06:37.040" style="s2">your frog friend.</p>
<p begin="00:06:34.720" end="00:06:38.120" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Edgar&#39;s your only choice. Marry him and</p>
<p begin="00:06:37.040" end="00:06:39.919" style="s2">you save the kingdom.</p>
<p begin="00:06:38.120" end="00:06:41.560" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Okay, but if I ever get married, I want</p>
<p begin="00:06:39.919" end="00:06:43.400" style="s2">it to be for love, not gold.</p>
<p begin="00:06:41.560" end="00:06:44.080" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This isn&#39;t about gold. It&#39;s about saving</p>
<p begin="00:06:43.400" end="00:06:44.800" style="s2">our kingdom.</p>
<p begin="00:06:44.080" end="00:06:48.160" style="s2">&gt;&gt; But father</p>
<p begin="00:06:44.800" end="00:06:49.360" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Enough. King Edgar is already here.</p>
<p begin="00:06:48.160" end="00:06:52.680" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Pull yourself together. Stand up</p>
<p begin="00:06:49.360" end="00:06:56.480" style="s2">straight, be respectful, and be polite.</p>
<p begin="00:06:52.680" end="00:06:58.760" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ah, there&#39;s my beautiful future bride.</p>
<p begin="00:06:56.480" end="00:07:00.160" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s King Edgar&#39;s?</p>
<p begin="00:06:58.760" end="00:07:02.240" style="s2">I&#39;m really disappointed in both of you.</p>
<p begin="00:07:00.160" end="00:07:04.560" style="s2">You never cared what I wanted. I can&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:07:02.240" end="00:07:08.080" style="s2">stay here another second. I&#39;m leaving.</p>
<p begin="00:07:04.560" end="00:07:10.040" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Wait. Where did my wife go?</p>
<p begin="00:07:08.080" end="00:07:12.600" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hi Frank. I brought you lunch. That&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:07:10.040" end="00:07:14.240" style="s2">normal, right?</p>
<p begin="00:07:12.600" end="00:07:16.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The queen wants to see you.</p>
<p begin="00:07:14.240" end="00:07:20.280" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What queen? I don&#39;t know any queen.</p>
<p begin="00:07:16.520" end="00:07:20.280" style="s2">Hey, what are you doing? Let me go.</p>
<p begin="00:07:24.080" end="00:07:28.960" style="s2">Put me down. I can walk.</p>
<p begin="00:07:25.680" end="00:07:28.960" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Orders are orders.</p>
<p begin="00:07:29.960" end="00:07:34.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You again?</p>
<p begin="00:07:32.000" end="00:07:37.160" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Miss me?</p>
<p begin="00:07:34.440" end="00:07:38.680" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Maybe a little.</p>
<p begin="00:07:37.160" end="00:07:41.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Enough. [clears throat]</p>
<p begin="00:07:38.680" end="00:07:43.520" style="s2">All right, ugly girl. Would you marry</p>
<p begin="00:07:41.520" end="00:07:45.680" style="s2">this?</p>
<p begin="00:07:43.520" end="00:07:45.680" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh.</p>
<p begin="00:07:52.480" end="00:07:56.600" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Frank?</p>
<p begin="00:07:55.000" end="00:07:57.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m human again.</p>
<p begin="00:07:56.600" end="00:07:58.960" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re</p>
<p begin="00:07:57.520" end="00:08:02.000" style="s2">really handsome.</p>
<p begin="00:07:58.960" end="00:08:02.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I was handsome before.</p>
<p begin="00:08:02.480" end="00:08:08.640" style="s2">The curse is breaking.</p>
<p begin="00:08:04.360" end="00:08:08.640" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No, stop it. I command you.</p>
<p begin="00:08:10.840" end="00:08:15.600" style="s2">Is that Molly?</p>
<p begin="00:08:12.960" end="00:08:15.600" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Much better.</p>
<p begin="00:08:15.840" end="00:08:19.360" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:08:17.320" end="00:08:21.320" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why is my armor getting bigger?</p>
<p begin="00:08:19.360" end="00:08:22.400" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s not. You&#39;re getting smaller.</p>
<p begin="00:08:21.320" end="00:08:24.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We all</p>
<p begin="00:08:22.400" end="00:08:24.720" style="s2">are.</p>
<p begin="00:08:30.720" end="00:08:34.680" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who are you really?</p>
<p begin="00:08:32.520" end="00:08:36.719" style="s2">And how did you become a frog?</p>
<p begin="00:08:34.680" end="00:08:38.719" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m Prince Frank.</p>
<p begin="00:08:36.719" end="00:08:40.680" style="s2">Years ago, a woman fell in love with me.</p>
<p begin="00:08:38.719" end="00:08:42.280" style="s2">I I didn&#39;t love her back. And I was</p>
<p begin="00:08:40.680" end="00:08:44.120" style="s2">cruel when I rejected her.</p>
<p begin="00:08:42.280" end="00:08:45.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So, she cursed you?</p>
<p begin="00:08:44.120" end="00:08:46.839" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She paid a sorcerer to do it.</p>
<p begin="00:08:45.520" end="00:08:49.160" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Frank,</p>
<p begin="00:08:46.839" end="00:08:52.320" style="s2">I love you. This is for you.</p>
<p begin="00:08:49.160" end="00:08:56.640" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m sorry. I don&#39;t feel the same.</p>
<p begin="00:08:52.320" end="00:08:58.120" style="s2">I was young, and honestly, I was a jerk.</p>
<p begin="00:08:56.640" end="00:09:00.080" style="s2">By sunset,</p>
<p begin="00:08:58.120" end="00:09:02.440" style="s2">I wasn&#39;t human anymore.</p>
<p begin="00:09:00.080" end="00:09:03.800" style="s2">I was trapped here for years. Everyone</p>
<p begin="00:09:02.440" end="00:09:05.480" style="s2">ran from me.</p>
<p begin="00:09:03.800" end="00:09:07.480" style="s2">You were the first person who stayed.</p>
<p begin="00:09:05.480" end="00:09:09.400" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So, you&#39;re the missing Prince Frank, the</p>
<p begin="00:09:07.480" end="00:09:10.880" style="s2">richest prince in all the kingdoms?</p>
<p begin="00:09:09.400" end="00:09:13.481" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I don&#39;t know if I&#39;m still that rich.</p>
<p begin="00:09:10.880" end="00:09:14.120" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh, you are. Definitely.</p>
<p begin="00:09:13.481" end="00:09:15.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:09:14.120" end="00:09:19.600" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The queen never finished her question,</p>
<p begin="00:09:15.440" end="00:09:20.960" style="s2">so let me ask. Agnes, will you marry me?</p>
<p begin="00:09:19.600" end="00:09:23.120" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hmm.</p>
<p begin="00:09:20.960" end="00:09:24.440" style="s2">Not a bad idea.</p>
<p begin="00:09:23.120" end="00:09:25.926" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Is that a yes?</p>
<p begin="00:09:24.440" end="00:09:27.946" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s a yes.</p>
<p begin="00:09:25.926" end="00:09:27.946" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:09:28.520" end="00:09:31.920" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your [music] support keeps Fable Pop</p>
<p begin="00:09:29.720" end="00:09:34.441" style="s2">alive, so like and subscribe, and give</p>
<p begin="00:09:31.920" end="00:09:36.461" style="s2">us a reason to exist.</p>
<p begin="00:09:34.441" end="00:09:36.461" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:09:37.960" end="00:09:45.160" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Guard, go bring me my husband.</p>
<p begin="00:09:41.040" end="00:09:45.160" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh god, save me from this woman.</p>
</div>
</body>
</tt>
